---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/layout/Navbar.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Mantiqh"
  description="Privacy Policy for Mantiqh Technologies."
  canonicalURL="https://mantiqh.com/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="bg-white text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen">
    <div class="bg-white flex flex-col flex-grow max-w-[1440px] mx-auto w-full border-x border-slate-200/20 relative">
      <Navbar theme="light" />

      <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-6 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-10">
        <header class="pb-4 space-y-4">
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Welcome to Mantiqh.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Mantiqh ("Mantiqh", "we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting the privacy and personal information of our clients, business partners, website visitors, and users. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, store, and safeguard your information when you interact with our website, products, services, or communicate with us.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            By accessing or using our website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy and agree to the practices described herein.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
          {/* Information We Collect */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Information We Collect
            </h2>
            <p>
              Depending on how you interact with Mantiqh, we may collect the following information:
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 pl-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Personal Information</h3>
              <p>Information you voluntarily provide, including:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-700 pl-4">
                <li>Full Name</li>
                <li>Company Name</li>
                <li>Job Title</li>
                <li>Email Address</li>
                <li>Phone Number</li>
                <li>Business Information</li>
                <li>Project Requirements</li>
                <li>Any information submitted through contact forms, consultation requests, career applications, or other communications.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 pl-2 pt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Technical Information</h3>
              <p>We may automatically collect technical information such as:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-700 pl-4">
                <li>IP Address</li>
                <li>Browser Type</li>
                <li>Device Information</li>
                <li>Operating System</li>
                <li>Website Usage Data</li>
                <li>Pages Visited</li>
                <li>Referral Sources</li>
                <li>Session Duration</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="text-slate-600 italic">
                This information helps us understand user behavior and improve our website.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 pl-2 pt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Communication Information</h3>
              <p>
                Records of emails, contact form submissions, consultation requests, customer support inquiries, and other communications with Mantiqh.
              </p>
              <p class="pt-1 text-slate-600">
                We do not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under the age of 16.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          {/* Purpose of Data Collection */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Purpose of Data Collection
            </h2>
            <p>We collect and process information to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 pl-4">
              <li>Respond to enquiries and consultation requests.</li>
              <li>Deliver our products and professional services.</li>
              <li>Process business proposals and project discussions.</li>
              <li>Improve website performance and user experience.</li>
              <li>Enhance our AI, consulting, software development, cloud, and digital transformation services.</li>
              <li>Send service-related updates and business communications.</li>
              <li>Send marketing communications where permitted and with your consent.</li>
              <li>Detect fraudulent or unauthorized activities.</li>
              <li>Comply with applicable legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          {/* Data Sharing */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Data Sharing
            </h2>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">
              Mantiqh does not sell, rent, or trade personal information.
            </p>
            <p>Information may be shared only when necessary with:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 pl-4">
              <li>Trusted technology partners and service providers.</li>
              <li>Cloud hosting providers.</li>
              <li>Analytics and website service providers.</li>
              <li>Professional advisors.</li>
              <li>Government or legal authorities where required by applicable law.</li>
              <li>Third parties involved in mergers, acquisitions, or business restructuring, where legally permitted.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="pt-1 text-slate-600">
              All third-party partners are contractually required to maintain appropriate confidentiality and security standards.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Data Retention */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Data Retention
            </h2>
            <p>We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 pl-4">
              <li>Provide requested services.</li>
              <li>Maintain business relationships.</li>
              <li>Fulfill contractual obligations.</li>
              <li>Meet legal, tax, accounting, or regulatory requirements.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              When information is no longer required, it is securely deleted, anonymized, or archived in accordance with applicable laws.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Your Rights */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Your Rights
            </h2>
            <p>Subject to applicable laws, you may have the right to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 pl-4">
              <li>Access your personal information.</li>
              <li>Correct inaccurate information.</li>
              <li>Request deletion of your personal information.</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</li>
              <li>Restrict or object to certain processing activities.</li>
              <li>Request data portability where applicable.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              Requests regarding your personal information may be submitted using the contact details provided below.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Data Security */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Data Security
            </h2>
            <p>
              We implement appropriate administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards to protect personal information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, misuse, or destruction.
            </p>
            <p>
              These measures include secure infrastructure, access controls, encryption where appropriate, and ongoing security monitoring.
            </p>
            <p>
              Although we strive to maintain strong security standards, no internet transmission or electronic storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Contact & Communication Consent */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Contact & Communication Consent
            </h2>
            <p>
              By voluntarily submitting your contact information through our website, consultation forms, newsletters, or other communication channels, you authorize Mantiqh and its authorized representatives to contact you via:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 pl-4">
              <li>Email</li>
              <li>Telephone</li>
              <li>SMS</li>
              <li>WhatsApp</li>
              <li>Other relevant communication channels</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              This communication may include responses to enquiries, project discussions, service updates, business communications, and marketing information where permitted by applicable law.
            </p>
            <p>
              You may withdraw your communication consent at any time by contacting us.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Third-Party Services */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Third-Party Services
            </h2>
            <p>
              Our website may contain links to third-party websites, products, or services.
            </p>
            <p>
              Mantiqh is not responsible for the privacy practices, policies, or content of external websites. Users are encouraged to review the privacy policies of any third-party websites they visit.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* International Data Transfers */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              International Data Transfers
            </h2>
            <p>
              Where necessary, your information may be processed or stored using trusted cloud infrastructure or service providers located in jurisdictions outside your country of residence.
            </p>
            <p>
              Mantiqh takes reasonable measures to ensure that appropriate safeguards are maintained for international data transfers.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Changes to this Privacy Policy */}
          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Changes to this Privacy Policy
            </h2>
            <p>
              Mantiqh may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in business operations, legal requirements, or technology.
            </p>
            <p>
              Updated versions will be published on this page together with the revised "Last Updated" date.
            </p>
            <p>
              Continued use of our website after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised Privacy Policy.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* Contact Us */}
          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Contact Us
            </h2>
            <p>
              If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your privacy rights, please contact us.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Mantiqh</p>
              <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@mantiqh.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hello@mantiqh.com</a></p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
